# The geometry core is COPY'd into several images as a named build context
# (`--build-context cyberwave-geometry=common/geometry`). A CMake build tree
# from a developer's machine must never travel with it: its CMakeCache.txt
# records absolute host paths, and CMake refuses to configure against a cache
# written for a different source directory. That failure is confusing and
# machine-dependent, so it is excluded here rather than left to chance.
#
# .gitignore already covers these for commits; this file covers image builds,
# which do not consult .gitignore.
**/build/
**/_build/
**/*.egg-info/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
*.dll
*.o
*.a
